#
# CQ3 (INHABITED-COMPETENCY.md, INHABITED-RUNTIME-STACK.md): two simultaneous
# sessions — same subject or shared model? The subject-stage / model-artifact
# split discriminates. Over two-sessions.ttl the two sessions' invocations trace
# to the SAME gmeow:ModelArtifact (a shared MODEL), yet each session carries a
# DISTINCT gmeow:sessionSubjectStage (a different SUBJECT). This query returns
# each session with its subject stage, so the two distinct stages show the
# sessions are NOT the same subject despite sharing a model — the discrimination
# a single collapsed tenure could not express.
PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
SELECT ?session ?subjectStage WHERE {
    ?session a gmeow:AgentSession ;
        gmeow:sessionSubjectStage ?subjectStage .
}
ORDER BY ?session
